---

<Base
  title="León Palafox — Media, Talks & Interviews"
  description="Media appearances, interviews, talks, and public writing by León Palafox on AI, machine learning, data science, and financial technology."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Media"
    jp="メディア"
    title="Columns, podcasts & interviews"
    description="Public conversations about artificial intelligence, data strategy, and the future of technology in Mexico and the world."
  />

  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-14 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
    <SectionHeading title="Columns — El Financiero" id="columns" />
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted">
      I write a regular column for <em>El Financiero</em> on the business impact of AI, sovereignty, and technical
      strategy. Recent columns also appear on the <a href="/blog/" class="text-signal-deep underline underline-offset-3 hover:text-signal">blog</a>.
    </p>
    {
      columns.map((group) => (
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl">
          <h3 class="micro-label text-signal-deep">{group.year}</h3>
          <ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-hairline">
            {group.items.map((item) => (
              <li>
                <a href={item.href} class="group flex items-baseline gap-5 py-3.5">
                  <span class="micro-label w-14 shrink-0 text-muted">{item.date}</span>
                  <span class="flex-1 leading-snug" lang="es">
                    {item.title}
                  </span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-signal-deep transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">
                    →
                  </span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-14 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
    <SectionHeading title="Podcasts & talks" id="talks" />
    <ul class="mt-8 max-w-3xl divide-y divide-hairline">
      {
        talks.map((talk) => (
          <li>
            <a href={talk.href} class="group flex items-baseline gap-5 py-4">
              <span class="flex-1 leading-snug">
                <span class="font-medium" lang="es">{talk.title}</span>
                <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">{talk.outlet}</span>
              </span>
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-signal-deep transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-14 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
    <SectionHeading title="Research highlights" id="research-highlights" />
    <div class="mt-8 grid max-w-4xl gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_320px]">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">NVIDIA</h3>
        <p>
          NVIDIA interviewed me about our work with the Lunar and Planetary Laboratory at the University of Arizona:
          <strong>MarsNet</strong>, a convolutional neural network that identifies land features on the surface of
          Mars from HiRISE imagery.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/deep-learning-image-understanding-planetary-science/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-signal-deep"
        >
          Read the NVIDIA Developer Blog post
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <Image
        src={nvidiaPhoto}
        alt="León Palafox interviewed by NVIDIA about MarsNet and machine learning for planetary sciences"
        widths={[320, 640]}
        sizes="(min-width: 768px) 320px, 100vw"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full border border-hairline object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-14 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
    <SectionHeading title="Press mentions" id="press" />
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Interviews, profiles, and commentary in Mexican and international media on AI, data strategy, and the
      technology industry.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://mexicobusiness.news/cloudanddata/news/ai-hype-business-impact-why-corporate-ai-breaks"
      class="group mt-8 grid max-w-4xl gap-6 border border-hairline bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-signal lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,340px)_1fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-8 lg:p-6"
    >
      <Image
        src={mbnHero}
        alt="León Palafox, Director of AI Innovation Laboratory at GBM, pictured for the Mexico AI, Cloud & Data Summit 2026. Photo: Mexico Business News."
        widths={[340, 680, 1020]}
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 340px, 100vw"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full border border-hairline object-cover"
      />
      <div>
        <p class="micro-label text-signal-deep">Mexico Business News</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold leading-snug">
          From AI Hype to Business Impact: Why Corporate AI Breaks
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">AI, Cloud &amp; Data · October 20, 2026</p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          On why corporate AI projects stall when they automate broken processes, how the gap between IT and the
          business erodes value, and why the business — not IT — has to decide what gets built.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-signal pl-4 leading-relaxed">
          “If the process was broken, you are only going to break it much faster. If the process was ugly, you are
          going to make that ugly process much faster, until you reach a bottleneck.”
        </blockquote>
        <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-signal-deep">
          Read the article
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-8">
      {
        press.map((group) => (
          <div>
            <h3 class="micro-label text-signal-deep">{group.year}</h3>
            <ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-hairline">
              {group.items.map((item) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={item.href} class="group flex items-baseline gap-5 py-4">
                    <span class="micro-label w-14 shrink-0 text-muted">{item.date}</span>
                    <span class="flex-1 leading-snug">
                      <span class="font-medium" lang="es">
                        {item.title}
                      </span>
                      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted" lang="es">
                        {item.outlet}
                      </span>
                      {item.note && (
                        <span class="mt-2 block max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted" lang="es">
                          {item.note}
                        </span>
                      )}
                    </span>
                    <span
                      aria-hidden="true"
                      class="shrink-0 text-signal-deep transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
                    >
                      →
                    </span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
